 - Through the involvement of our own property valuation specialist, on a sample basis, we assessed the valuation process and significant assumptions and critical judgement areas by benchmarking the key assumptions to external industry data and comparable property transactions, in particular the yields applied;
 - We considered the adequacy of the disclosures in the consolidated financial statements, and the Group’s descriptions regarding the inherent degree of subjectivity and the key assumptions in estimates.

